A completely redesigned SmartAir app, based on the original intelligent air conditioning, and integrates more intelligent elements to provide various services for the user's household air-related intelligent products and create a comfortable, healthy and clean household air environment. 
1. Control the Haier smart appliances by phone, which is secure, convenient, efficient and easy to master; 
2. With cloud adaptation and cloud reminder, you can enjoy comfortable air from owning Haier smart appliances; 
3. With remote control, you can enjoy the comfortable home environment; 
4. Sleep curve cares for your sleep; 
5. More intimate services are waiting for you, such as life reminder, air reporting and cloud timer; (Some features require a working Internet connection, Wi-Fi)

Feature:
    1. Manage and control your smart devices anytime, anywhere;
    2. Support multiple device access, sockets/switches/curtains/bulbs/light strips, etc.;
    3. Easily share equipment with family and friends, and the whole family can easily enjoy smart life;
    4. Fast Bluetooth network configuration, support multiple devices to configure the network at the same time, no need to wait;
    5. Support voice control smart devices such as Amazon Echo and Google Home;
    6. Variety of themes, one device supports a variety of themes with different styles, and it is fresh to play;
    7. Protect your digital privacy, support use without a registered account, no phone, no email, but complete functions.

